  <Intro>k__BackingField: Seven clan halls stand in the hills, and whoever holds most of them speaks for all. The Bloodmoon clan holds two already and wants the rest.
  <Outro>k__BackingField: Five halls fly the Ironjaw banner. The other two send gifts and say they always meant to.
  <Goal>k__BackingField: Hold five towns at once.
